# Security

What this project does to protect itself, and the settings for each part.

<!-- moarch:security-guide -->

## Before going live

- `ENVIRONMENT=production`, a random `JWT_SECRET` (if the project has auth)
  and your real origins in `CORS_ORIGINS`; the app refuses to start without.
- Serve over HTTPS only, behind a load balancer that sets `X-Forwarded-For`
  (the Dockerfile runs uvicorn with `--proxy-headers`).
